<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 两个进展</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>共同点：harness 从「产品的一部分」变成「你可以改的东西」</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 420, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>之前</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", marginTop: 10}}>产品的一部分</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", marginTop: 8}}>你只能适配</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 708, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Box style={{width: 64, height: 2, background: "#0F6E56"}}></Box><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56"}}>现在</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 10}}>你可以改的东西</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", marginTop: 8}}>可以被讨论、被替换、被自己定。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", marginTop: 18}}>不谈谁更强，谈这一层从不可动变成了可动。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>38 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
